    <string name="data_readme">This folder holds the Galeri Reels app\'s data:\nwhich videos you liked and how many times you watched each one (galerireels-veri.json).\n\nThis data stays here even if you uninstall and reinstall the app. When you reinstall,\njust choose this folder (Documents › GaleriReels) when the app asks;\neverything comes back.\n\nDon\'t delete, move or rename this folder or the files in it.\nTo back it up, copy the folder as it is.\n</string>
