    <string name="protect_data_title">Let\'s protect your data</string>
    <string name="protect_data_body">Your likes and view counts will be stored in a folder on your phone, so they aren\'t lost even if you uninstall and reinstall the app.\n\nThe window that opens will show the Documents › GaleriReels folder: tap \"Use this folder\" and then \"Allow\". The app only sees this folder. If you installed it before, do the same and your old data comes back.</string>
